WEBVTT

00:18:59.836 --> 00:19:03.916
if you aren't really intentional
in thinking about your social fitness?

00:19:05.716 --> 00:19:11.476
RW: That question of how do we assess
our social fitness,

00:19:11.516 --> 00:19:13.836
it's really checking in and saying,

00:19:13.876 --> 00:19:17.436
am I as connected as I would like to be

00:19:17.476 --> 00:19:18.916
to other people?

00:19:18.916 --> 00:19:21.716
And if I'm not, what am I missing?

00:19:21.756 --> 00:19:25.876
So not all relationships provide us
with the same stuff.

00:19:25.876 --> 00:19:30.396
Some relationships are relationships
we have because they're fun,